{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：19:20 2026-11-26 HKT<br/>發佈時間：19:20 2026-11-26 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：19:20 2026-11-26 HKT</p><p>將軍澳昭信路近銀澳路，今日（11月26日）下午5時許有鹹水管爆裂，黃泥水湧出馬路，蔓延至附近單車徑、行人路和隧道。其間，車輛要涉水而行，途人亦紛紛躲避，行人隧道前斜坡亦猶如激流。水務署接報趕至搶修，警方亦到場協助封鎖道路，避免其他車輛靠近。</p><p>運輸署晚上7時表示，因水管爆裂，昭信路往將軍澳醫院方向近銀澳路全線封閉，多條巴士線需要改道行駛，包括九巴第49、297、N293線、過海巴士第N691線。</p><img alt=\"鹹水管爆裂，黃泥水湧出馬路。FB：方國珊\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5665e54b1fc4ca20436cddf15beba5d7/2026-11/928769471_1727410992082873_5774044431061433886_n_0.jpg\"/><img alt=\"積水蔓延至附近單車徑和行人路。FB：王文議員辦事處\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/95d5500ff58170f7dfdcd671b5a81b17/2026-11/926150434_122195797292647407_8726402506076674766_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"積水蔓延至附近單車徑和行人路。FB：Luk Chi Keung\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/32a48cb00d05fa8f718cf44566bf0a40/2026-11/917180351_10242167623144914_3941226081838099756_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"行人隧道變激流。FB：Luk Chi Keung\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d2856c990e6abf3a508c0ce35cbbe517/2026-11/925879549_10242167623104913_1980282292347365022_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"行人隧道變激流。FB：Push 4 Allez\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/41f9e4a69eaf8a0eed6d87b14833b302/2026-11/vlcsnap-2026-11-26-19h15m36s606.png\"/><img alt=\"行人隧道變激流。FB：Push 4 Allez\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fca1d5212463b78d5e6515f61f09868e/2026-11/vlcsnap-2026-11-26-19h15m52s249.png\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T11:43:58.652799+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":281,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T11:20:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T12:17:27.971330+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T11:37:28.756049+00:00","content_hash":"e4a222f8eec25664801e853b2cf7c6eb4b9b7f28a5c8cf06a41d9c41affce7d1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}